OL,3,GNEWSAMany hydrants lacking flow needed
OL,4,Afor firefighting needs, fire chiefs say
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The very least firefighters should be
OL,7,Fable to rely on is access to the water
OL,8,Fthey need to protect people," said NFCC
OL,9,Fchairman Phil Garrigan.
